## Article 159. Written proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article159WrittenProceedings:
  input case content AdministrativeCase
  input allPartiesConsent content YesNo
  input caseFactsEstablished content YesNo
  input disputeOfLawOnly content YesNo
  output canUseWrittenProceedings content YesNo

scope Article159WrittenProceedings:
  label written_default definition canUseWrittenProceedings equals No

# Written proceedings when all parties consent and facts are established
  label written_consent exception written_default
  definition canUseWrittenProceedings under condition
    allPartiesConsent = Yes
    and caseFactsEstablished = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Pure questions of law can use written proceedings
  label written_law exception written_default
  definition canUseWrittenProceedings under condition
    disputeOfLawOnly = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 160. Statement of claim

```catala
declaration scope Article160StatementOfClaim:
  input statement content WrittenStatement
  input specifiesCourt content YesNo
  input specifiesPlaintiff content YesNo
  input specifiesDefendant content YesNo
  input specifiesDisputeSubject content YesNo
  input specifiesGrounds content YesNo
  input specifiesEvidence content YesNo
  input specifiesReliefSought content YesNo
  input specifiesAttachedDocuments content YesNo
  output statementMeetsRequirements content YesNo

scope Article160StatementOfClaim:
  label requirements_default definition statementMeetsRequirements equals No

  label requirements_met exception requirements_default
  definition statementMeetsRequirements under condition
    statement.statementType = StatementOfClaim
    and specifiesCourt = Yes
    and specifiesPlaintiff = Yes
    and specifiesDefendant = Yes
    and specifiesDisputeSubject = Yes
    and specifiesGrounds = Yes
    and specifiesReliefSought = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 161. Content of statement of claim

```catala
declaration scope Article161ClaimContent:
  input statement content WrittenStatement
  input containsFactualGrounds content YesNo
  input containsLegalGrounds content YesNo
  input containsEvidenceList content YesNo
  input containsCostCalculation content YesNo
  input containsReliefRequested content YesNo
  output claimContentComplete content YesNo

scope Article161ClaimContent:
  label content_default definition claimContentComplete equals No

  label content_complete exception content_default
  definition claimContentComplete under condition
    containsFactualGrounds = Yes
    and containsLegalGrounds = Yes
    and containsEvidenceList = Yes
    and containsReliefRequested = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 162. Attachments to statement of claim

```catala
declaration scope Article162Attachments:
  input statement content WrittenStatement
  input proofOfFeePayment content YesNo
  input proofOfServiceToDefendant content YesNo
  input powerOfAttorney content YesNo
  input copiesForAllDefendants content YesNo
  output attachmentsComplete content YesNo

scope Article162Attachments:
  label attachments_default definition attachmentsComplete equals No

  label attachments_complete exception attachments_default
  definition attachmentsComplete under condition
    proofOfFeePayment = Yes
    and proofOfServiceToDefendant = Yes
    and copiesForAllDefendants = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 163. Filing electronic statement of claim

```catala
declaration scope Article163ElectronicFiling:
  input statement content WrittenStatement
  input electronicSystemAvailable content YesNo
  input plaintiffHasElectronicSignature content YesNo
  output canFileElectronically content YesNo

scope Article163ElectronicFiling:
  label electronic_default definition canFileElectronically equals No

  label electronic_available exception electronic_default
  definition canFileElectronically under condition
    electronicSystemAvailable = Yes
    and plaintiffHasElectronicSignature = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 164. Defense statement (response to claim)

```catala
declaration scope Article164DefenseStatement:
  input statement content WrittenStatement
  input filedByDefendant content YesNo
  input respondsToEachClaim content YesNo
  input statesDefendantPosition content YesNo
  input listsDefenseEvidence content YesNo
  output defenseMeetsRequirements content YesNo

scope Article164DefenseStatement:
  label defense_default definition defenseMeetsRequirements equals No

  label defense_complete exception defense_default
  definition defenseMeetsRequirements under condition
    statement.statementType = DefenseStatement
    and respondsToEachClaim = Yes
    and statesDefendantPosition = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 165. Objections and additional statements

```catala
declaration scope Article165Objections:
  input statement content WrittenStatement
  input filedWithinDeadline content YesNo
  input respondsToNewCircumstances content YesNo
  output objectionCanBeAccepted content YesNo

scope Article165Objections:
  label objection_default definition objectionCanBeAccepted equals No

  label objection_timely exception objection_default
  definition objectionCanBeAccepted under condition
    filedWithinDeadline = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label objection_new_circumstances exception objection_default
  definition objectionCanBeAccepted under condition
    respondsToNewCircumstances = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
